 "kit_note": "S81-SLICE 10-18 (s81-vpnorm): 16 hard hcpl lanes (114.48 sq, pins on all 4 faces) on a 172.8 um pitch (43.2 lattice; the earlier 129.6 pitch left 15.1 um channels < the 20 um rule) in a 4x4 grid x,y 43.2..676.1; the 2 leaf-store SRAMs on the 43.2 lattice in the top band (y 734.4, x 129.6 / 432.0, 128 um channel between them down to the lanes); one contiguous std-cell band y 676..864 (sequencer, bank ports, lane feed) plus the face pin-flop ring and the 58 um lane channels; every port on a full face, ranges proportional to bits, rescaled to the 734.4 x 864 outline (N <=1.1 / E,W <=1.1 pins/um); clk / rst_n at the N face centre region beside the sequencer + bank-port register mass. N = slice centre (c, sw, cw, lo), E = vn seam, W = vs seam. Previous: OWNERS-S81/VP 10-18 (kit spec, gate only after the s81sl_hcpl view closes): 16 hard hcpl lanes on a 129.6 um pitch (43.2 lattice, 15.12 um channels) in the lower 4x4 grid y 43.2..546.5; the 2 leaf-store SRAMs on the 43.2 lattice in the top band (y 604.8, x 43.2 / 345.6, pins N toward the centre-facing face, 128 um channel between them down to the lanes); one contiguous std-cell band y 546.5..734.4 (sequencer, bank ports, lane feed) plus the face pin-flop ring; every port on a full face, ranges proportional to bits (N 783 / E 923 / W 704 pins: <=1.3 pins/um); clk / rst_n at the N-face centre, beside the sequencer + bank-port register mass. N = slice centre (c, sw, cw, lo), E = vn seam, W = vs seam.",
